{"id": "mission-rock-infrastructure-budget-and-delay", "title": "Mission Rock’s first phase finished three years after its target", "seconds": 48.7, "voice": "elevenlabs:OtHu0lbpdNTqJVqaxDtR", "narrator": "Maven", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "01cf6e9674df3c02", "words": 151, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Mission Rock had a deadline for its first phase.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 2.29, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["When", "were", "the", "streets", "finished?"], "sub": "The original target was February 2022"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.35, 0.56, 0.69, 0.76, 1.15, 1.27, 1.4, 1.64]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The agreement targeted February 2022.", "t0": 2.41, "t1": 4.7, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "first", "kicker": "The original target was February 2022", "text": "The original target", "mark": "The"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.51, 0.94, 1.41, 1.68]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The original horizontal construction budget was $145.4 million.", "t0": 4.92, "t1": 9.44, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$145.4 million", "label": "The horizontal construction budget rose $73.1 million"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.53, 1.02, 1.54, 1.85, 2.05, 2.25, 2.56, 3.21, 3.49, 3.73, 4.01]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "By October 2023 the budget reached $218.5 million.", "t0": 9.56, "t1": 14.11, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["2019 approved budget", "$145.4 million"], "b": ["October 2023 budget", "$218.5 million"], "kicker": "Horizontal construction"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.61, 0.89, 1.61, 1.77, 2.09, 2.34, 2.51, 2.78, 3.21, 3.48, 3.78, 4.07]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Park scope changed, and construction encountered difficult soils and underground utilities.", "t0": 14.23, "t1": 18.29, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "review", "kicker": "The horizontal construction budget rose $73.1 million", "text": "Scope and ground conditions", "mark": "Scope"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.26, 0.54, 1.01, 1.14, 1.67, 2.07, 2.49, 2.87, 3.0, 3.4]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The street improvement permit was one of several reported causes of delay.", "t0": 18.41, "t1": 21.51, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "permit", "kicker": "Public Works recorded a conditional completion milestone", "text": "What delayed the work?", "mark": "What"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.36, 0.79, 1.14, 1.29, 1.42, 1.51, 1.85, 2.24, 2.6, 2.7]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Public Works issued its conditional notice in November 2024.", "t0": 21.63, "t1": 25.2, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Conditional notice of completion"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.35, 0.69, 1.02, 1.16, 1.68, 2.09, 2.24, 2.69, 2.96]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The city analyst later described the project as three years behind its target.", "t0": 25.32, "t1": 28.83, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "permit", "kicker": "Public Works recorded a conditional completion milestone", "text": "April 2025 update", "mark": "April"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.41, 0.85, 1.09, 1.46, 1.57, 2.04, 2.18, 2.44, 2.67, 2.95, 3.1]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The Board completed acceptance steps in May 2025.", "t0": 28.95, "t1": 31.76, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "The City accepted the work and the Port booked its own assets", "text": "Acceptance and ownership", "mark": "Acceptance"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.38, 0.81, 1.3, 1.61, 1.74, 1.96, 2.22]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The Port recorded its own share of the infrastructure as capital assets.", "t0": 31.88, "t1": 35.1, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "audit", "context": "FY2025 audited financial statements", "heading": "Assets accepted by the Port", "layout": "amounts", "rows": [{"label": "Port capital assets", "value": "$124,185,000", "icon": "money"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.38, 0.82, 0.97, 1.16, 1.39, 1.47, 1.58, 2.18, 2.29, 2.68]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The completed phase delivered 537 apartments and a five-acre park.", "t0": 35.32, "t1": 39.33, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "update", "context": "Port update, June 2026", "heading": "Phase one delivery", "rows": [{"label": "Apartments", "value": "537", "icon": "building"}, {"label": "Below-market-rate units", "value": "132", "icon": "building"}, {"label": "China Basin Park", "value": "Five acres", "icon": "document"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.57, 0.89, 1.28, 1.58, 1.88, 2.38, 2.88, 2.99, 3.06, 3.59]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "Commissioners then approved a separate design investment for the next phase.", "t0": 39.45, "t1": 42.61, "shot": "s11", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "update", "kicker": "The next phase received a separate design authorization", "text": "Phase two authorization", "mark": "Phase"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.52, 0.66, 1.03, 1.11, 1.44, 1.76, 2.24, 2.36, 2.45, 2.67]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The remaining financial question is what each agency ultimately paid.", "t0": 42.73, "t1": 45.58, "shot": "s12", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Final cost by owner and work package"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.44, 0.85, 1.22, 1.31, 1.49, 1.7, 2.09, 2.52]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 45.7, "t1": 47.84, "shot": 